    "kicker": "Academic Psychology and Self-Worth",
    "h1": "Dating Someone Smarter or with Higher Grades Than You",
    "lede": "Dating a campus high-achiever or scholar can be immensely inspiring, but it can also trigger deep intellectual insecurity and jealousy. Here is how to navigate academic grade disparities with confidence, grace, and mutual admiration.",
    "date": "2026-09-27",
    "ctaHeading": "Connect with Ambitious, Supportive Students",
