        "question": "What if my high-achieving partner constantly corrects me in front of other people?",
        "answer": "Address this behavior immediately in private. Explain that public correction feels humiliating and disrespectful. A partner who genuinely loves you will apologize and adjust their behavior; chronic condescension indicates deep arrogance."
