        "question": "Can I ask the lecturer to move me to another group because my ex is in mine?",
        "answer": "Only as an absolute last resort if severe harassment, threats, or stalking exist. For standard relationship breakups, asking for a swap makes you appear unprofessional. Handling the project with composure demonstrates adult maturity."
